@startuml oidc_logout_sequence

!theme plain

title OpenID Connect Logout Flow

autonumber
autoactivate on

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFBD
}

actor "User Agent\n(Browser)" as UA
activate UA
participant "Frontend Portal" as PORTAL
participant "Identity Provider" as IDP
participant "Flexibility\nInformation System (FIS)\nAuth API" as AUTH

UA -> PORTAL: Click logout
return Go to /auth/v1/logout
UA -> AUTH: Navigate to /auth/v1/logout\n<:cookie:> __Host-flex_session
note over AUTH
    The session of the token is deleted with all
    its tokens, whichever of its tokens is sent.
    The access token expires on its own.
end note
return HTTP 302 Redirect to Identity Provider\nUnset <:cookie:> __Host-flex_session\nUnset <:cookie:> __Host-flex_access

UA -> IDP: Follow redirect\nGET /logout?post_logout_redirect_uri=<login url>
note over IDP
    Identity provider does logout
    and terminates sessions.
end note
return HTTP 302 Redirect to redirect uri

UA -> PORTAL: Follow redirect\nGET /#/login
return Welcome page

note over PORTAL
    User is now ready to log in again.
end note

@enduml
